[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5917207943","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/124037#issuecomment-5917207943","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124037","id":5917207943,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABYLFthw","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-30T18:24:52Z","updated_at":"2026-09-30T18:24:52Z","body":"This is not a bug, you are never creating an item with ID `-1` as `-1` is the placeholder for automatically assigning the index of the item, so the created item is actually ID `2`\n\nThis might be documented a little better in `AddItem`, as it only says \"If no id is passed, the item index will be used as the item's ID.\", not making it clear that `-1` is the same as that (it is implied from the default argument)","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5917207943/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0